Evaluate the integral \( \int_0^{\pi/2} f(x) \, dx \), where the function \( f(x) \) is defined as follows:
\[
f(x) = \begin{cases} 
\sin(x), & \text{if } \cos(x) \in \mathbb{Q} \\
\sin^2(x), & \text{if } \cos(x) \notin \mathbb{Q}
\end{cases}
\]

